WEBVTT

00:00:00.352 --> 00:00:04.524
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> At 8.45 last Saturday, I <b>was walking</b> in the park.

00:00:05.635 --> 00:00:06.990
The birds <b>were singing</b>.

00:00:07.972 --> 00:00:09.195
It <b>wasn’t raining</b>.

00:00:11.193 --> 00:00:12.939
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Was</b> it <b>raining</b> when you got up?

00:00:13.415 --> 00:00:14.563
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>No</b>, it <b>wasn’t</b>.

00:00:16.536 --> 00:00:19.700
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>What were</b> you <b>doing</b> at 11 o’clock last night?

00:00:20.671 --> 00:00:22.314
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>I was watching</b> TV.